    "answer": {
      "short": "7 cups of flour and 3 cups of cream",
      "worked": "Flour:\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\frac{3}{4}\\times4&=\\frac{7}{4}\\times\\frac{4}{1}\\\\&=\\frac{28}{4}\\\\&=7\\end{align*}$$\nCream:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{4}\\times4&=\\frac{3}{4}\\times\\frac{4}{1}\\\\&=\\frac{12}{4}\\\\&=3\\end{align*}$$\nJamie needs 7 cups of flour and 3 cups of cream.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
